- | 测试工程师<br>QA engineer | 只有正向页面描述，无法独立复现<br>Only happy-path screen descriptions exist | 正反例、边界、异常、权限、证据和回归范围<br>Positive/negative cases, boundaries, failures, permissions, evidence, and regression scope |
